    {
      "id": "_0gZgM3xkiYkFvyl03dH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 62,
      "y": 94,
      "width": 763.92,
      "height": 176.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 194903,
      "version": 100,
      "versionNonce": 661215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776504421609,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Configuration is provided at startup (loaded once).\n2. System receives request with (clientId: String, endpoint: String)\n3. Each endpoint has a config specifying:\n    - Algorithm to be used\n    - Algo-specific params (maxRequests, windowMs, capacity, refillRate)\n4. System enforces rate limits by checking clientId against endpoint config.\n5. Return result: (allowed: bool, remaining: int, retryAfterMs: long)\n6. If endpoint has no config, use a default limit.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Configuration is provided at startup (loaded once).\n2. System receives request with (clientId: String, endpoint: String)\n3. Each endpoint has a config specifying:\n    - Algorithm to be used\n    - Algo-specific params (maxRequests, windowMs, capacity, refillRate)\n4. System enforces rate limits by checking clientId against endpoint config.\n5. Return result: (allowed: bool, remaining: int, retryAfterMs: long)\n6. If endpoint has no config, use a default limit.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
